This distribution vendors no third-party source. It builds a C++ extension from
first-party source in src/sdm_relational_engine/csrc, and everything else it
depends on -- including the Predictive Query Language and the Universal TFM
wire types -- is resolved by the package manager at install time.

An earlier version of this package bundled a minified mermaid.js for rendering
a graph diagram. It no longer does: Graph.to_mermaid() returns the diagram
source, which any renderer draws, and carrying a JavaScript engine to draw a
picture was not a trade worth making.
